  of the same type if the class is moved from a section it was alone in. Returns
  true if the move was successful, otherwise false.",false,false,false,"C:/Programmi/OpenModelica/lib/omc/ModelicaBuiltin.mo",false,2417,1,2429,14,{},false,false) 20:43:47:129
